/* DESIGN Window definition (used by the UIB) 
  CREATE WINDOW V-table-Win ASSIGN
         HEIGHT             = 2.43
         WIDTH              = 99.6.
/* END WINDOW DEFINITION */
                                                                        */
&ANALYZE-RESUME

